# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Node
node_modules/
frontend/dist/

# Runtime cache for external data (geocoding / OSM / weather).
# Regenerated on demand; committed offline fixtures live under tests/.
.cache/
# Exception: a real, previously-fetched cache entry for the demo location
# (Hazratganj, Lucknow) is committed deliberately, so "Load Real Road
# Network" is instant and network-independent on both a fresh local clone
# and a fresh Render deploy - see backend/realdata/cache.py's own
# docstring on why provenance always says "cache", never "network", for
# these. Same real OSM/Nominatim data the app would fetch live; nothing
# fabricated, just pre-fetched once.
!.cache/geocoding/5e8e69edd905022d4d4a2b22788092a4.json
!.cache/osm/1a828627fe6ba36b14b6327d34eaae55.json

